  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Sea ice dissolved and particulate organic carbon constituents were investigated during the dark winter period, in the eastern Beaufort Sea, during the Circumpolar Flaw Lead (CFL) system study. The goal of this study was to provide winter baseline data on sea-ice microbial processes, for a better understanding of annual cycles of sea-ice carbon cycling in the Arctic."
